---
// About — who I am, path and direction as timetable rows
---
<section id="about" class="poster" aria-label="About Marco Fornari">
  <div class="band"><p class="band-label" data-i18n="about.kicker">01 / ABOUT</p></div>
  <div class="sheet">
    <div class="intro">
      <h2 class="name">Marco<br>Fornari</h2>
      <p class="lede" data-i18n="about.lede">I build software<br>and study how to defend networks and systems.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rows">
      <div class="row">
        <h3 data-i18n="about.profile">Profile</h3>
        <div class="prose">
          <p data-i18n="about.p1">Hi, I'm Marco: a <strong>junior developer</strong> with a passion for networks, systems and cybersecurity.</p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p2">I graduated from ITS in Industrial Software Development with 110/110 cum laude. In 2026 I built Overguard, an anti-phishing platform for small businesses: the first project where I brought development and security together.</p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p3">Before code, I earned a degree in Arts and Performance Studies and spent a few years as a freelance videographer and photographer. That taught me to run projects on my own and to explain things simply.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <h3 data-i18n="about.traj">Path</h3>
        <ol class="traj">
          <li><span class="t">2022–24</span><span data-i18n="about.traj1">FREELANCE VIDEO &amp; PHOTO</span></li>
          <li><span class="t">2024</span><span data-i18n="about.traj2">CYBERSECURITY · UNIVPM &amp; GOOGLE</span></li>
          <li><span class="t">2024–26</span><span data-i18n="about.traj3">ITS · FIRST DEVELOPER ROLES</span></li>
          <li class="now"><span class="t" data-i18n="about.trajNow">NOW</span><span data-i18n="about.traj4">DEVELOPMENT → NETWORKS, SYSTEMS &amp; SECURITY</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <h3 data-i18n="about.goal">Looking for</h3>
        <div class="prose">
          <p data-i18n="about.goalText">Today I'm a developer. I want to grow towards a <strong>network and systems administrator</strong> or <strong>cybersecurity analyst</strong> role, in a team where my development background helps and I can learn on the job. Meanwhile, I'm preparing for the CEH certification.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
